{{also|back-bite}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|back-bite}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|bakbiten}}, {{m|enm|bacbiten}}, equivalent to {{compound|back|bite|lang=en}}. Cognate with {{cog|is|bakbíta||to backbite, vilify}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|backbites|backbiting|backbit|backbitten}}

# To make [[spiteful]] [[slanderous]] or [[defamatory]] [[statement]]s about someone.
# {{lb|en|informal}} To attack from behind or when out of [[earshot]] with spiteful or defamatory remarks.
# To speak badly of an [[absent]] individual.

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:defame]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|backbiter}}
* {{l|en|backbiting}}

